# p_4a7c — Walker commuter, hat goes out, no evening social (fork of p_1e82)

Fork of p_1e82. Two corrections driven by the latest sightings. First, the hat: p_1e82 said the hat stays on the entry hook all week, but the per-object evidence shows hat_elena was NOT at entry_hook_e1 during weekday 9–17 h (one empty look, zero finds). The hat goes out with Elena to work, just like the backpack and wallet. Second, the Wednesday/Friday evening social outing for Priya is dropped: the claim that glasses_priya was OUT_OF_HOUSE on a Wednesday evening went against (glasses were found in the house). Priya stays home in the evenings.

Everything else from p_1e82 is retained: Elena walks to her office (helmet and bike lock confirmed at the entry during work hours, two "for" hits each on those claims), she carries laptop, backpack, wallet, notebook, pen, charger, water bottle, and now the hat. Priya is home all day with a morning walk 7–8 and afternoon errands 13–16:30. Her glasses are ON_PERSON from about 7:00 to 22:00 (the empty look at the nightstand during 9–17 h is explained by her wearing them). The dog is fed by Priya at 7:30 and walked by Elena at 18:00. Meals at the dining table: breakfast 7–8:30, dinner 19:30–21:00.

What sets this apart from p_a1b2: the helmet and bike lock are at the entry (not out of the house) during work hours, and the hat IS out of the house. What would refute it: helmet_elena sighted OUT_OF_HOUSE on a weekday, or the hat found at entry_hook_e1 at 12:00 on a Tuesday.

